# Source is source, even when it embeds a control character.
#
# components/AdminView.tsx built its filter key with two literal NUL bytes as separators, and git
# detects NUL in the first 8000 bytes as "binary": the file diffed as `Bin 17674 -> 18834 bytes`
# in every PR that touched it, so no reviewer could see what changed. Those two bytes are now
# written as escape sequences, but the rule belongs here rather than in one file's history: a
# readable diff should never depend on which bytes a string literal happens to contain.
*.ts diff
*.tsx diff
*.css diff
